    {
      "category": "offensive",
      "cost": "passive",
      "description": "<p>When casting Create Water, the dragon can attempt to destroy liquid instead of creating it, turning an equal amount of liquid into sand. This destroys liquid magic or alchemical items if they're of a lower level than the dragon (a creature can attempt a @Check[will|dc:32] save to protect all liquids in its possession). This doesn't affect the liquids in a creature's body.</p>",
